a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To me, the big drawback would be theeir society,pack life is harder if you're not a kickass badass</div> </div> </div> </div>That's not really an issue, there's places for werewolves who aren't badasses. That's arguably the point of a pack. There's plenty of bards, scholars, philosophers and programmers in the Uratha, and Aggression and Violence aren't Renown aspects.<br /> <br /> But yes, spirits dislike them and hosts hate them. Though hosts hate everyone, and at least a werewolf might recognize and kill a beshilu shard before it burrows into their belly and eats their heart.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 03-10-2017, 09:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T13:06:12-07:00","id":1061938,"title":"","content":"Could I be a Hunter? No? I'd settle for wolf-blooded if I got to pick my tell.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13063-lord-jub-jub","name":"Lord Jub-Jub","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13063_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T14:18:46-07:00","id":1061984,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lord Jub-Ju