/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T16:10:52-07:00","id":1062045,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wormwood</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/994648-you-as-a-player-character-what-splat-would-you-want-to-be?p=1061984#post1061984\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You could be whatever you'd like, but if you go for Hunter, I'd like to know which compact/conspiracy, since being Lucifuge is quite different from VASCU or Cheiron.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a tough pick but I think I'd go either Malleus Maleficarum or Aegis Kai Doru. I lean heavily towards MM though. Compact wise it's The Long Night.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13063-lord-jub-jub","name":"Lord Jub-Jub","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13063_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-15T15:57:53-07:00","id":1063006,"title":"","content":"My girlfriend would immediately say I qualify to be a Demon, and I think my gaming groups would agree. The described mindsets, concepts, and loose genre of capability often depicted as alien for the purpose of narrative make a lot of sense to me, and fractured time travel is just par for the course in how my mind moves linearly.<br /> <br /> However, my inherent issues with the upcoming gameline are exactly why I think Deviant is the splat that would best represent me. As a neurologically and physically divergent individual with multiple terminal diagnoses, it would probably be cathartic to have blame and purpose regarding my afflictions.<br /> <br /> As for which one I want, Vampire would probably be my ideal, especially in a city as small as the one I live in. Unlikely to be a Kindred hierarchy, werewolves, or anything else really.<br /> <br /> Still, as much as I would want to be a Ventrue, I think a Deviant just fits better.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11102-necrophear","name":"Necrophear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11102_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}